e\":\"raboukhalil\",\"matchLevel\":\"none\",\"matchedWords\":[]},\"story_text\":{\"value\":\"Hey HN!<p>I've been working on a book about <em>WebAssembly</em> over the last few months, and it's finally available at <a href=\\\"http://levelupwasm.com\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\">http://levelupwasm.com</a>!<p>Why a book on <em>WebAssembly</em> you ask? Well... <em>WebAssembly</em> is awesome (obviously ) but it's certainly not the easiest thing to learn. So I wrote this book as a practical intro to using <em>WebAssembly</em> in your web apps.<p>I would appreciate any feedback!\",\"matchLevel\":\"full\",\"fullyHighlighted\":false,\"matchedWords\":[\"webassembly\"]}},\"_rankingInfo\":{\"nbTypos\":0,\"firstMatchedWord\":0,\"proximityDistance\":0,\"userScore\":67,\"geoDistance\":0,\"geoPrecision\":1,\"nbExactWords\":0,\"words\":1,\"filters\":1}},{\"title\":\"The Bytecode Alliance: Building a secure, composable future for WebAssembly\",\"url\":\"https://hacks.mozilla.org/2019/11/announcing-the-bytecode-alliance/\",\"author\":\"markdog12\",\"points\":407,\"num_comments\":255,\"story_id\":21515725,\"created_at_i\":1573578304,\"created_at\":\"2019-11-12T17:05:04Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2024-09-20T05:06:45Z\",\"_tags\":[\"story\",\"author_markdog12\",\"story_21515725\"],\"children\":[21515862,21515884,21515958,21515969,21516079,21516129,21516432,21516509,21516629,21516672,21516690,21516811,21516839,21516890,21516901,21516934,21517120,21517121,21517265,21517534,21517704,21517960,21518019,21518044,21518082,21518419,21520565,21520646,21521644,21522996,21523005],\"objectID\":\"21515725\",\"_highlightResult\":{\"title\":{\"value\":\"The Bytecode Alliance: Building a secure, composable future for <em>WebAssembly</em>\",\"matchLevel\":\"full\",\"fullyHighlighted\":false,\"matchedWords\":[\"webassembly\"]},\"url\":{\"value\":\"https://hacks.mozilla.org/2019/11/announcing-the-bytecode-alliance/\",\"matchLevel\":\"none\",\"matchedWords\":[]},\"author\":{\"value\":\"markdog12\",\"matchLevel\":\"n